    narr:Narrative_PipelineSlugGeneration skos:note "When a memory is submitted without an explicit id field, the pipeline must derive a slug — either via an LLM id-gen call or a deterministic slugify fallback — and commit the file successfully. This narrative validates that fallback path. Phase 2 confirms the same failure pattern reproduces from prod at ## heading level: the pipeline must not crash and must produce a valid slug." .
  }
}
